Third-party components used by the BlitzHash kit overlay
========================================================

1) Glances — https://github.com/nicolargo/glances
   License: LGPL-3.0-only
   Used as the default host + container health Web UI (image: nicolargo/glances).

2) Dozzle — https://github.com/amir20/dozzle
   License: MIT
   Used as the default live Docker logs viewer (image: amir20/dozzle).

3) CodeMirror 5 — https://github.com/codemirror/codemirror5
   License: MIT
   Loaded from jsDelivr CDN in the Functions Admin browser UI only (not vendored).

4) Official Supabase Docker Compose — https://github.com/supabase/supabase/tree/master/docker
   License: Apache-2.0
   Fetched at a pinned self-hosted tag by setup.sh into ./supabase-project/ (gitignored).

BlitzHash's own code in this repository is MIT (see LICENSE / NOTICE).
